{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Place your bets.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>It's called 'operating costs' in business terms. Salary, hazard pay, material and medical costs, you know the drill.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play your cards.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>One firefight isn't a gamble, but surviving 7 in a row? What do you think your chances are?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">House always wins.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Risk your life for scraps while your bosses eat like kings. You'll get there eventually. You're just one promotion away!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Business is a battlefield in the world of Kiloton. Hire your soldiers, fire your guns, then fire your soldiers when the earnings report is due.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Black Company.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as the CEO of a subsidiary company to a second-rate arms dealer, managing the business by entering warzones with your employees and coming out with loot in order to keep up with the ever-growing quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire more employees to handle your battles, purchase guns and cybernetics to turn them into killing machines, and when they're injured or can't keep up... well, it's your choice to keep them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3535980?t=1742831357","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535980/ed599557063a1df2e3ece19daab4cf961fbf1e8c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742831357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535980/aed4c3fdbc1de15972c9bb4e2666dd56e3a4bd3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742831357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535980/aed4c3fdbc1de15972c9bb4e2666dd56e3a4bd3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742831357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Place your bets.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>It's called 'operating costs' in business terms. Salary, hazard pay, material and medical costs, you know the drill.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play your cards.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>One firefight isn't a gamble, but surviving 7 in a row? What do you think your chances are?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">House always wins.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Risk your life for scraps while your bosses eat like kings. You'll get there eventually. You're just one promotion away!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Business is a battlefield in the world of Kiloton. Hire your soldiers, fire your guns, then fire your soldiers when the earnings report is due.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Black Company.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as the CEO of a subsidiary company to a second-rate arms dealer, managing the business by entering warzones with your employees and coming out with loot in order to keep up with the ever-growing quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire more employees to handle your battles, purchase guns and cybernetics to turn them into killing machines, and when they're injured or can't keep up... well, it's your choice to keep them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Smugpire"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535980/9606ebf377bd82c4ab1b6a032f131d57c3f29d47/header.jpg?t=1742831357","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Kiloton: Black Company","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Smugpire"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"